ALL of this goes INSIDE the existing `AppTheme` class in lib/theme/app_theme.dart as new `static const` members plus retoned `light()`/`dark()`. Nothing is renamed; `AppTheme.gold`, `cardFace`, `pipRed`, `pipBlack`, `shadowFor`, `liftElevation`, `controlShadow`, `paletteFor`, `TablePalette` all keep their exact signatures.

// ---------- 1. THE GROUND: charcoal ramp (dark mode is the design's home) ----------
